  "comment": "Install apt-get install ifenslave apt -y install ifenslave modprobe bonding modprobe 8021q echo 'bonding' &gt;&gt; /etc/modules echo '8021q' &gt;&gt; /etc/modules Interface Down ifdown eth0 (Repeat for all interfaces included in the bond) ifdown enp3s0 ifdown enp2s0 /etc/init.d/networking stop Edit vi /etc/network/interfaces # The primary network interface allow-hotplug enp2s0 allow-hotplug enp3s0 auto",
